          "final_response": {
            "parts": [
              {
                "text": "That sounds like an exciting trip! To help you plan your visit to Tokyo in August, I can provide information on a few key aspects:\n\n1. **Weather**: Knowing what the weather is typically like in August can help with your packing and activity planning.\n2. **Local Attractions**: Suggestions for must-see places and activities in Tokyo.\n3. **Currency Exchange**: Help with converting your currency to Japanese yen (JPY).\n\nPlease let me know which information you'd like to start with or if you need assistance with all of them!"
              }
