          "final_response": {
            "parts": [
              {
                "text": "Here's some helpful information for your upcoming trip to Tokyo in August:\n\n### Weather in Tokyo:\n- **Current Temperature**: 22°C\n- **Condition**: Partly cloudy\n- **Humidity**: 65%\n- **Wind**: 12 km/h\n- **Forecast**: Mild weather with occasional clouds expected throughout the day. August is usually warm and humid, so be prepared for hot weather and occasional rain showers.\n\n### Local Attractions in Tokyo:\n1. **Tokyo Tower**: A famous communications and observation tower. Perfect for panoramic views of the city.\n2. **Senso-ji**: An ancient Buddhist temple, great for experiencing traditional Japanese culture.\n3. **Shibuya Crossing**: Known as the busiest pedestrian crossing, an iconic spot to experience the hustle and bustle of Tokyo.\n4. **Meiji Shrine**: A Shinto shrine dedicated to Emperor Meiji, set in a beautiful forested area.\n5. **Tokyo Skytree**: A broadcasting and observation tower offering stunning views.\n\n### Currency Exchange:\n- **Exchange Rate**: 1 USD = 149.5 JPY\n\nThis rate means if you exchange 1 USD, you'll receive 149.5 Japanese Yen. Be sure to check the exchange rate closer to your travel date, as it can fluctuate.\n\nIf you have any more questions or need further assistance with your itinerary, feel free to ask!"
              }
            ],
